lso acquired U.S. equities through mergers and reincorporations that involve stock swaps, but these acquisitions have been relatively small in recent years, with no acquisitions in 2008, and acquisitions of less than $1 billion in 2009. Stock swap acquisitions picked up to over $8 billion in 2010, but this pace of acquisition again declined during the first three quarters of 2011 to less than $3.3 billion (Stock swaps data for the most recent quarter are Federal Reserve Board/Treasury estimates and are subject to substantial revisions.) These stock swaps are not reported under the TIC reporting system, but are available on the TIC Website. The TIC Website also provides estimates from the Federal Reserve Bank of New York on principal repayment flows of foreign holdings of U.S. government agency and corporate asset-backed securities (ABS). These repayments are estimated to have reduced foreign net purchases of U.S. securities by $191 billion in 2008, $204 billion in 2009, $232 billion in 2010, and $119 billion in the first three quarters of 2011.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [113, 1810, 1519, 1959], \"page_id\": 95}], \"content\": \"After including stock swaps and accounting for ABS repayment flows, net foreign acquisitions of U.S. securities totaled $224 billion in 2008, as foreign investors acquired U.S. securities in the first half of the year, but on net sold U.S. securities in the second half of the year. Foreign net purchases recovered to $436 billion in 2009. The pace of acquisition picked up further in 2010, when foreign net purchases were recorded at $685 billion, surpassing those in 2008 and 2009 and nearly recovering the momentum recorded in 2007. The pace of acquisition has slowed so far in 2011, with acquisitions in the first three quarters of the year recorded at only $276 billion.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1992, 297, 2018], \"page_id\": 95}], \"content\": \"December 2011\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [665, 94, 965, 127], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": \"CAPITAL MOVEMENTS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1455, 97, 1490, 127], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": \"91\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [328, 200, 1302, 304], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": \"CHART CM-D.\\u2014Net Purchases of Long-Term Foreign Securities by U.S. Investors\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [220, 370, 1413, 893], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [233, 929, 1415, 1002], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [233, 1087, 1419, 1384], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th colspan=\\\"6\\\">[In millions of dollars. Source: Treasury International Capital Reporting System]</th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">Type</th><th colspan=\\\"6\\\">Calendar years</th></tr><tr><th>2007</th><th>2008</th><th>2009</th><th>2010</th><th>2011 Jan. - Sept.</th><th>2011 July - Sept.</th></tr><tr><td>Foreign bonds</td><td>133,905</td><td>-53,942</td><td>127,474</td><td>54,644</td><td>14,931</td><td>3,346</td></tr><tr><td>Foreign stocks</td><td>95,300</td><td>-20,246</td><td>59,360</td><td>60,615</td><td>80,301</td><td>17,076</td></tr><tr><td>Total</td><td>229,205</td><td>-74,188</td><td>186,834</td><td>115,259</td><td>95,232</td><td>20,422</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [250, 1402, 1044, 1454], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": \"* Net purchases by U.S. investors equal net sales by foreigners, or gross sales minus gross purchases of securities.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [182, 1523, 1452, 1709], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": \"The data on this page represent U.S. investors' purchases and sales of long-term foreign securities as reported to the TIC reporting system. U.S. investors also have acquired foreign stocks through mergers that involve stock swaps. Net acquisitions through stock swaps amounted to $12 billion in 2007, $7 billion in 2008, $2 billion in 2009, $12 billion in 2010, and $11 billion during the first three quarters of 2011. (Stock swaps data for the most recent quarter are Federal Reserve Board/Treasury estimates and are subject to substantial revisions.) These stock swaps are not reported under the TIC reporting system, but are available on the TIC Website.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [184, 1716, 1450, 1841], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": \"Including acquisitions through stock swaps, U.S. net purchases of long-term foreign securities amounted to $241 billion in 2007. U.S. investors switched to net sales of $67 billion in foreign securities in 2008 but resumed their net purchases of foreign securities in 2009 with acquisitions of $189 billion. Net purchases slowed in 2010 to $127 billion but have picked up slightly during the first three quarters of 2011 to $106 billion.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1333, 1985, 1494, 2015], \"page_id\": 96}], \"content\": \"December 2011\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [144, 97, 177, 127], \"page_id\": 97}], \"content\": \"92\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [665, 99, 965, 127], \"page_id\": 97}], \"content\": \"CAPITAL MOVEMENTS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [250, 196, 1381, 280], \"page_id\": 97}], \"content\": \"SECTION V.\\u2014Holdings of, and Transactions in,